00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
A good goodbye... It's all that matters.

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Goodbye June is a drama film directed by Kate Winslet.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Four siblings' lives change drastically when their ailing mother
takes a turn for the worse over the holiday season.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
June, played by Helen Mirren.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Helen, played by Toni Collette.

6
